                <pb facs="0891" n="795" sameAs="frus:frus1921v02/pg795"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">361.11/3724: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Norway</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Schmedeman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Christiania</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-05-12T15:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 12, 1921—3
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received May 12—2:39 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>19. Your 19, May 10, noon. Nansen much pleased with your message and sees no
                    objection to publication. He thinks of sending the text to the Soviets.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Schmedeman</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
